    "content": "## 第十三课：中英文法规表达卡\n\n以下句子用于英文笔试和专业面试，重点是准确表达法律分析，不是逐字翻译法条标题。\n\n| 中文表达 | 推荐英文表达 | 适用位置 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 在适用法律允许的范围内 | to the extent permitted by applicable law | 合同保留句 |\n| 以取得审批为交割先决条件 | make the approval a Condition Precedent to Closing | SPA/备忘录 |\n| 需向主管机关核验 | should be confirmed with the competent authority | 法律意见边界 |\n| 需向经办银行核验材料 | should be confirmed with the handling bank | SAFE/购汇 |\n| 不应作绝对结论 | should not be stated as an absolute conclusion | 风险提示 |\n| 视交易时点而定 | depends on the transaction date | 历史题/过渡法 |\n| 视主体和资金路径而定 | depends on the entities involved and the funds flow | 外债/担保 |\n| 受负面清单限制 | subject to the restrictions in the Negative List | FDI |\n| 适用准入前国民待遇 | subject to pre-establishment national treatment | FDI |\n| 穿透最终受益人 | trace through to the ultimate beneficial owner | NSR/反洗钱 |\n| 实际控制或实际影响 | control or actual influence in substance | NSR |\n| 未缴出资责任 | liability for unpaid capital contribution | 公司法 |\n| 加速到期 | acceleration of the contribution obligation | 公司法第54条 |\n| 股权转让责任 | liability arising from a transfer of equity | 公司法第88条 |\n| 解除质押 | release of the share pledge | Closing deliverable |\n| 质押登记 | pledge registration / registration for perfection | CSDC |\n| 合法处置担保物 | lawfully enforce and dispose of the collateral | 融资/违约 |\n| 购汇和跨境汇出 | purchase of foreign exchange and remittance abroad | SAFE |\n| 资金用途限制 | restrictions on the use of proceeds | 外债/DCM |\n| 充分且具体披露 | fairly and specifically disclosed | Disclosure Letter |\n| 交割日重复确认 | bring-down at Closing | R&W |\n| 不成比例影响回拨 | disproportionate-effect carve-back | MAE |\n| 不得重复受偿 | no double recovery | Indemnity |\n| 赔偿可回收性 | recoverability of the indemnity | Escrow |\n| 监管延迟 | regulatory delay | Long-stop |\n| 替代交易结构 | alternative transaction structure | 备选方案 |\n\n### 口答万能四句\n\n> **The starting point is the transaction structure and the relevant date.**\n>\n> **We should separate mandatory legal or regulatory conditions from risks that can be allocated contractually.**\n>\n> **I would verify the position with the relevant authority, registry or handling bank and reflect the result in the SPA or offering documents.**\n>\n> **If the gating issue cannot be resolved by the long-stop date, the client should retain a commercially workable fallback or termination right.**\n\n## 当前进度与下一课\n\n- 已完成：第一课至第十三课，覆盖基础概念、实体法、跨境监管、SPA、资本市场、英文笔试、技术面试、术语记忆和每日训练。\n- 已保留：全书索引、间隔复习路线、主动回忆卡、14 天每日一题和最终考试清单。\n- 下一步：继续扩充真题逐题拆解，或将每日训练改造成可打印的复习卡片版本。\n\n学习资料与规则核对原则仍适用：历史题仅用于还原考点，法律结论按现行有效规则和交易时点核实；属地登记、经办银行和监管操作要求需向相关机关或专业机构确认。"
